				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					2.5
				</span></i>
			 : pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦρμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					54
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				450
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.174
			</span></i>: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					565
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠέρθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1651
				</span></i>
			, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.341
			</span></i>, 
