				<u>Heracl.</u>
				322
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴ. λόγῳ</span>
			<i>to exaggerate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>lift and take away, remove</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό με τιμᾶν ἦραν</span>”
